hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"141","Ahmad ibn Abdah al-Dhabi told us, Hammad, meaning Ibn Zayd, informed us, on the authority of Ghailan ibn Jarir, on the authority of Abu Burdah, on the authority of Abu Musa, he said: “I entered On the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, while he was using the siwak toothpick on his tongue, and he was saying: “Aaaaaaa.”"
